5e20; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 15px;\">Medidas Antropométricas</h3>   <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">     <tr style=\"background: #f0f4f1; color: #2e7d32;\">       <th style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; text-align: left;\">Circunferências</th>       <th style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; text-align: right;\">(cm)</th>       <th style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; text-align: left;\">Dobras (Petroski)</th>       <th style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; text-align: right;\">(mm)</th>     </tr>     <tr>       <td style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Cintura</td>       <td style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; text-align: right;\"><b>{{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json['Cintura (cm)'] }}</b></td>       <td style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Tríceps</td>       <td style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; text-align: right;\"><b>{{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json['Dobra Tríceps (mm)'] }}</b></td>     </tr>     <tr>       <td style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Quadril</td>       <td style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; text-align: right;\"><b>{{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json['Quadril (cm)'] }}</b></td>       <td style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Subescapular</td>       <td style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; text-align: right;\"><b></b>{{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json['Dobra Subescapular (mm)'] }}</td>     </tr>     <tr>       <td style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Braço Direito</td>       <td style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; text-align: right;\"><b>{{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json['Braço Direito (cm)'] }}</b></td>       <td style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Suprailíaca</td>       <td style=\"padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; text-align: right;\"><b>{{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json['Dobra Suprail